# The end of a race and back to the menu (docs/port/SYNTH.md 2): one player, gRace 2 on track 0, whose race has a
# time limit (15 s here). When it runs out: _EndGame (0x1000000), the results (0x2000000, 30 s), the game over screen
# (0x800000), where UP goes from its first option to Quit and A takes it: state 4 with gSkipToGameState 0x10, which
# passes on to the main menu (0x10).
# until: 0x800000:300
# seconds: 120
# expect: state=0x00000010: players 1, windows 1
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
15 DOWN 0.1    # the mode screen: two modes down, gRace 2
15.2 DOWN 0.1
17 A
20 A           # the track select: track 0
23 A           # the car select
88 UP 0.1      # the game over screen (from about 86 s): Quit
90 A
